			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild config from spaces to hard tabs\n\nAlign the two ESBuild configuration files with the project-wide tab-based indentation convention. The previous commit (c09abac) had applied 2-space indentation; this reverts to hard tabs for consistency with the broader Worker element codebase and the convention established in 5d1c9ba.\n\n- `Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js`: convert 2-space indent to tabs, expand `__name` helper and `Target_default` async arrow to multi-line tab-indented form, add trailing commas throughout, collapse export to single-line\n- `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`: convert 2-space indent to tabs, expand `On` const declaration across multiple lines, add trailing commas throughout the config object, collapse export to single-line\n\nZero functional changes — build output is identical.",
